Description: Build without cinnamon-settings-daemon
 Muffin's test suite, which alone asks for it, defines no tests, and on
 Ubuntu the daemon pulls in a cinnamon-desktop library that takes Linux
 Mint's one over, so Muffin built in a PPA would link against the wrong one.
Author: machine-setup
Forwarded: not-needed
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -11,7 +11,6 @@ Build-Depends:
         dbus <!nocheck>,
         dmz-cursor-theme <!nocheck>,
         gnome-pkg-tools (>= 0.10),
-        cinnamon-settings-daemon <!nocheck>,
         gobject-introspection (>= 1.41.3),
         gtk-doc-tools (>= 1.15),
         libcairo2-dev (>= 1.10.0),
